`IsSpreadBoundedRWSkylineAt standard 2 floor` (same floor, hence not lost). This is the floor-tracked
maximal piece set closed by a single uniform pocket drop, feeding `reservoirCarrier_fill_step` with
`floor' = floor`. The S and Z phases additionally consume their floor-tracked `floorNotch` bricks. -/
theorem isSpreadBoundedRWSkylineAt_flat_pocket_of_isLevelPocketBandAt {floor : ℕ} {b : Board}
    {p : Piece} (hp : p = Piece.O ∨ p = Piece.I ∨ p = Piece.T ∨ p = Piece.L ∨ p = Piece.J)
    (hb : IsLevelPocketBandAt GameConfig.standard 2 floor b) :
