residual width at columns `pc + 3 .. pc + 6`. The left-riser mirror of the `L` arc; with `J` the
geometric fill layer is complete for every flat piece, so an incoming non-staircase piece always
has a self-regenerating landing on a wide pocket no matter which of the five it is. Floor is fixed
