/-- **The all-seven standard board survives every adversarial next piece.** The non-loss face of
`isSpreadBoundedRWSkyline_all7_valley_standard`: composing that single-board all-seven valley closure
with `not_isLost_of_isSpreadBoundedRWSkyline` (every spread-bounded reserved-well board sits wholly
